{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, דְּקַק","hw":"דְּקַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דְּקַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be shattered, fall to pieces (</strong>BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:35\" href=\"/Daniel.2.35\">Dn 2:35</a>.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <em>break in pieces:</em> Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַדֶּ֫קֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:34\" href=\"/Daniel.2.34\">2:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:45\" href=\"/Daniel.2.45\">45</a>, 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַדִּ֑קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">6:25</a> (all sq. acc.); Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּדִּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:40\" href=\"/Daniel.2.40\">2:40</a> (abs.), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:44\" href=\"/Daniel.2.44\">44</a> (acc.); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּדֱּקִנַּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:23\" href=\"/Daniel.7.23\">7:23</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהַדֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:40\" href=\"/Daniel.2.40\">2:40</a> (acc.), f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַדֱּקָה</span> (K<sup>§ 46, 3b)</sup>) abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:19\" href=\"/Daniel.2.19\">19</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, דָּר²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, דְּנָה"}